Name: Yashu Agarwal Student ID: 14644734 GitHub: https://github.com/yashuagarwal2/PacStudent_Assessment_3-4 

A Pac-Man–style 2D game made in Unity 6 (6000.4.11f1) for 31263/32004 Introduction to Game Development, Assessments 3 and 4.

How to play

Open Assets/Scenes/StartScene and press Play.

W A S D: move
Space: dash (Level 2 only)
Levels
Level 1: recreation of the classic game.
Level 2: adds a dash ability and Speed Boost / Ghost Freeze pickups.
